# FloodShield AI — Frontend Environment Variables

# Backend API Configuration
# Example: http://localhost:8000 (local) or https://api.floodshield.app (production)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Optional: Analytics, Monitoring, etc.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=your-analytics-id
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=your-sentry-dsn

# Note:
# - All NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are exposed to the browser (safe for non-sensitive config)
# - Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values before running `npm run dev`
# - Never commit .env.local to version control
# - For production, set these variables in your hosting platform's environment settings
